  title: A Frozen Wall
  image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: a5e8599a9919c614b8e364ec4851edaa, type: 3}
  eventDescription: A glacier stands in your way, it is made of solid ice. You could
    destroy it, how would you do it?
  randomCardsAvailable: 5
  conditions:
  - _requirementString: You could use a fire elemental card...
    _successString: The heat of your fire elemental card thawed some of the ice.
    _failString: 'The card heat wasn''t enough to thaw ice. '
    _filter:
      rid: 4405684306645352449
  - _requirementString: The stronger the card, the better.
    _successString: The card could afford shattering some of the ice perfectly.
    _failString: The wall didnt budge from the card strength.
    _filter:
      rid: 4405684306645352450
  - _requirementString: A card with destructive properties
    _successString: The cards attack aided in damaging the wall
    _failString: The card wasnt particularly offensive to damage the wall
    _filter:
      rid: 4405684306645352454
  - _requirementString: A card with high cost may push this wall aside easily
    _successString: Every mana used was put into destroying this wall.
    _failString: Your attack didnt use too much mana, so it wasn't as effective.
    _filter:
      rid: 4405684306645352455
